Thank you for having me.

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:49.050
I want to thank all of these
people that reached out to me.

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:52.830
And special thanks to my
husband, who seriously really

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:54.900
helped me prepare this talk.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:56.940
There's my get hub
link again if you

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:58.800
want to take a picture of it.

